{"id":1838430,"retrievedAt":"2026-11-22T18:43:24.826Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[{"id":10402,"name":"Music"},{"id":99,"name":"Documentary"}],"homepage":"","id":1838430,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["SK"],"original_language":"sk","original_title":"Posledný bohém - Karol Duchoň 70","overview":"A recording of a concert marking what would have been the 70th birthday of Karol Duchoň... A giant of Slovak popular music, the \"Slovak Tom Jones,\" a true musical treasure. He was even called the \"Slovak Gott,\" and many remain convinced to this day that, had his life not been cut short by his battle with personal demons, no one in Czechoslovakia could have surpassed his talent. He participated in numerous musical and television projects, earning acclaim, admiration, and popularity both at home and abroad. His artistry and magnificent music will be celebrated by some of today’s most popular singers: Mário \"Kuly\" Kollár, Ondřej Gregor Brzobohatý, Nela Pocisková, Martin Chodúr, Lukáš Adamec, and Ján Slezák. Through special video segments, those who walked part of life’s path alongside him—Zoro Laurinc, Ľuboš Zeman, Marcela Laiferová, Eva Máziková, Dušan Grúň, and Ľubo Belák—share both lighthearted and serious memories of Karol Duchoň.","popularity":0,"poster_path":null,"production_companies":[],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"2020-06-13","revenue":0,"runtime":112,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[{"english_name":"Slovak","iso_639_1":"sk","name":"Slovenčina"}],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"The Last Bohemian: Karol Duchoň 70","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":3922625,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Mário Kollár","original_name":"Mário Kollár","popularity":0.0458,"profile_path":"/a45BgY2WHVrILkg7V1YOdoaMhT9.jpg","cast_id":1,"character":"Self","credit_id":"6b02df7b2893b51fea59621